            "richContent": [
              [
                {
                  "text": [
                    "Below this are a few links related to how Virginia\u0027s self-help resources can help you, and how you can qualify. Our phone number and hours are listed on the \u0027Get Help - Main Page\u0027. For specific office locations, there is a link below for that too.\n\nIf you would like to try and briefly describe what legal issues you need help with, I can also help direct you to specific resources on our website.\n\nAdditionally, I will provide you a link below to a short video about how to get legal assistance from Virginia\u0027s self-help resources and other available legal resources."
